# Cloudflare Pages headers. Defense in depth — Access should be the real gate, but this page
# carries real portfolio positions, so keep it out of search engines and out of frames regardless.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
